# Themes

- Every styled component needs a `*.<id>.theme.ts` for each shipped theme (currently `base`, `carbon`)
- Import `*Theme` type from the sibling `.vue` file
- `classes` keys map to template slots/elements; use function form `({ props, slots, data }) => [...]`
- `styles` uses `colors.getPalette()`, `css()`, and CSS variables — follow `Button.base.theme.ts`
- Export default theme object; register in every `themes/<id>/components.ts` with matching key name
- Global theme entries: `packages/ui/src/themes/<id>/index.ts` (`classPrefix: 'x-'`)
- New shipped theme pack: `.cursor/skills/add-theme/SKILL.md`

When changing one theme variant, check whether the others need the same logical change.

Reference: `packages/ui/src/components/button/theme/Button.base.theme.ts`
